<item><title>Iama Barge Ramp Upgrade Project</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Torres Strait Island Regional Council invites tenderers from suitably qualified tenderers for the Iama Barge Ramp Upgrade Project. The upgrade works involve the removal and replacement of damaged sections of barge ramp as per designs and includes but not limited to:<br /><br />- Site establishment and disestablishment <br /><br />• Documentation, project management and compliance with all regulations, <br /><br />• Stakeholder Consultations in conjunction with TSIRC for temporary closure of barge ramp, <br /><br />• Geotechnical Investigations, <br /><br />• Survey, <br /><br />• Quality Assurance and Quality Control, <br /><br />• Environmental Management, <br /><br />• Demolition of existing Structures, <br /><br />• Excavation of materials, <br /><br />• Concrete Works in tidal area, <br /><br />• Precast Panel casting/supply/install, <br /><br />• Installation of rock revetment, and <br /><br />• Any other item included in the contract documents and not detailed above.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Torres Strait Island Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531942<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
