<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Seqwater is seeking suitably qualified delivery partner(s) capable of supporting its enterprise SCADA platform with:<br /><br /> - Project management and delivery governance<br /><br /> - Platform selection support<br /><br /> - Solution architecture and design<br /><br /> - Platform build and integration<br /><br /> - Migration and cutover<br /><br /> - Cyber security engineering<br /><br /> - Testing and assurance<br /><br /> - Organisational change and training<br /><br /> - Sustainment and capability transfer<br /><br /> - PLC integration and interface assessment<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Seqwater<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 04/Dec/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531855<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Indust. Automat'n, Process Control, Utilities<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
