<item><title>RFT 2526-117 Cuttagee Bridge Replacement</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Tenders are invited from qualified entities to undertake the replacement of the existing Cuttagee Bridge at Cuttagee Lake with a new two lane structure with a shared path and barriers, and associated roadworks and ancillary work. <br /><br />The Works include construction of a Temporary Bridge and Track to facilitate public traffic access while the existing bridge is demolished, and the replacement bridge is constructed. <br /><br />Pre-tender meetings will be held: <br /><br />•	Online via MS Teams on Thursday, 12 November 2026 at 10:00am AEDT<br /><br />•	MANDATORY - Onsite at project location (Southern end of existing bridge) on Wednesday, 18 November 2026 at 1:00pm AEDT<br /><br />Tenderers are to register via VendorPanel confirming attendee names and contact details a minimum of two business days prior to each session.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Bega Valley Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 14/Dec/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531859<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
