<item><title>Castlemaine Art Museum Redevelopment - Stage 1 Construction Works</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Mount Alexander Shire Council (Council) invites tenders for construction of the Castlemaine Art Museum (CAM) Stage 1 redevelopment. This brief explains the project context, site constraints, conservation requirements and delivery expectations that must be addressed in the Contractor's methodology, programme and price. This document must be read alongside the other RFT documents and is to be included in the Contract Documents.<br /><br />The procurement is for construction of the provided design. The Project’s design consultants have prepared the drawings and technical specifications. Contractor design obligations are limited to temporary works, installation and fabrication detailing, and any specialist design expressly allocated in the Contract.<br /><br />Site Inspection (Mandatory)<br /><br />1:30pm, Wednesday 11 November 2026<br /><br />14 Lyttleton Street, Castlemaine<br /><br />RSVP your attendance via email to procurement@mountalexander.vic.gov.au<br /><br />The meeting is an opportunity for potential t...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Mount Alexander Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 07/Dec/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531873<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 24]]></description>
