<item><title>Provision of Minor Civil Works</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Townsville City Council (the Principal) is seeking to establish a register of pre-qualified suppliers to provide schedule of rates for civil maintenance works.<br /><br />The Principal requires that the successful suppliers be suitably qualified and experienced in civil construction activities.<br /><br />The Contract will have five Workstreams as follows:<br /><br />• WS1 – Concrete Works<br /><br />• WS2 – Pipe Patching and Relining<br /><br />• WS3 – Masonry Work, Structural Landscapes and other Minor Civil Works<br /><br />• WS4 – Minor Road Works<br /><br />• WS5 – Street/Road/Park Furniture, Facilities & Structures<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Townsville City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 30/Nov/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531889<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Horticulture & Arboriculture, Signs & Barriers<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
