<item><title>Village Cafe Coffee Service 2027</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Self sufficient barista and coffee service for Village Café will be needed between February and November 2027. <br /><br />Village Cafe events on Thursday mornings, starting in the second week of the month, at Kingswood, North St Marys and Llandilo.<br /><br />The successful supplier will be required to: <br /><br />- Attend all Village Café sessions between February and November 2027. Village Cafe is on Thursday mornings, starting in the second week of the month, Village Café rotates from Kingswood, North St Marys and Llandilo <br /><br />- Provide a self-sufficient service with own generator, either as a van/cart/trailer set up <br /><br />- Provide beverages for a range of dietary requirements including coffee, alternative milks, tea, hot chocolate, fruit juice <br /><br />- In warm weather, offer iced-coffees <br /><br />- Participate in impact measurement and reporting activities as requested by Council (once per quarter)<br /><br />- Build rapport with residents and maintain positive interactions throug...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Penrith City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531840<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Catering & Hospitality, Food & Beverage Products, Venue Hire<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
