<item><title>PR000138 - Weir Tower Access Walkway Replacement</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Charters Towers Regional Council invites tenders from suitably qualified respondents to complete the works required for the Weir Tower Access Walkway Replacement Project.<br /><br />This project, Weir Tower Access Walkway Replacement, includes the replacement of the existing elevated walkway to access the Weir Tower during flood inundation events. The project will include the removal and demolition of the existing structural steel walkway including the platform and handrails. The existing steel trestles will be maintained and remediated (abrasive blasted and painted).<br /><br />Further information can be found in the Tender documentation.<br /><br />Council reserves the right to invite all tenderers to change their tenders to take account of a change in the tender specification.<br /><br /> <br /><br />Council's representative for this tender is Paul Weston, Procurement & Depot Coordinator, who can be contacted on 07 4761 5300.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Charters Towers Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 24/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531815<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Indust. Production, Manufacturing<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 11]]></description>
