<item><title>Preferred Supplier Arrangement (PSA) for Provision of Compliance and WHS Training Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Livingstone Shire Council (Council) invites submissions from suitably qualified and experienced Registered Training Organisations (RTOs), accredited training providers and specialist consultants for the establishment of a Preferred Supplier Arrangement for Compliance and Workplace Health and Safety (WHS) Training Services.<br /><br />The objective of this arrangement is to establish a panel of capable, responsive and suitably qualified providers to deliver high-quality, compliant and industry-recognised training services across a range of operational, regulatory and workforce development requirements. The arrangement will support Council in maintaining workforce capability, meeting legislative and compliance obligations, and fostering a safe and productive workplace.<br /><br />The Contract will be administered under a Goods and Services Agreement as detailed in the Tender Documents.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Livingstone Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531769<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Carmen Mundy Email: carmen.mundy@livingstone.qld.gov.au Tel: 07 4939 9881<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Training & Development<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
