<item><title>Notice to Register for upcoming ITO – Student Program Planning and Progression Validation Solution</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Notice to Register for the upcoming ITO – Student Program Planning and Progression Validation Solution<br /><br /> <br /><br />The University of Queensland (UQ) intends to issue an Invitation to Offer (ITO) for the provision and implementation of a Student Program Planning and Progression Validation solution, including associated support and maintenance services, in the first week of November 2026.<br /><br />Many programs at UQ offer students multiple pathways to attain a qualification. UQ currently relies on highly manual and fragmented processes to interpret complex program rules, support student planning, validate academic progression and confirm graduation eligibility. These processes create operational challenges and can negatively impact the student experience.<br /><br />UQ is seeking a subscription-based commercial off-the-shelf (COTS) Student Program Planning and Progression Validation solution to address these challenges. The scope also includes professional services for implementation, integration...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> The University of Queensland<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 03/Nov/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531573<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
