<category>IT &amp; Telecomms</category>
</item>
<item><title>Sports &amp; Recreation Plan</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> PREPARATION OF MCKINLAY SHIRE SPORT AND RECREATION PLAN<br /><br />McKinlay Shire Council invites your firm to submit a written quotation for the provision of specialised consultancy services to develop a comprehensive, forward-looking Sport and Recreation Plan.<br /><br />1. Project Overview & Background<br /><br />Council is committed to fostering active, healthy, and connected communities across our region. To ensure our sport, active recreation, and community infrastructure effectively meet current and future needs, Council is seeking an experienced consultancy firm to undertake a complete review and redevelopment of our strategic framework for sport and recreation.<br /><br />To assist in understanding our contextual foundation and strategic alignment, Council will provide successful respondents/tenderers with copies of:<br /><br />•	McKinlay Shire Council 2010 Sport and Recreation Plan<br /><br />•	McKinlay Shire Council Community Strategic Plan 2019-2026<br /><br />•	McKinlay Shire Council Corporate Pl...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> McKinlay Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 20/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531607<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Amanda Warry Email: amanda.warry@mckinlay.qld.gov.au Tel: 07 4746 4208<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Management Advisory Services, Sport, Recreation Equip, Services, Travel & Tourism<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
