<item><title>201175 Footpath Grinding and Ancillary Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Sutherland Shire Council (SSC) invites Tenders from suitably qualified and experienced person(s), firm or entities for appointment of a single Principal Contractor to provide concrete footpath grinding and Ancillary Services, on an as-needed basis, within the boundaries of the Sutherland Shire Local Government Area (LGA) as the Principal Contactor.<br /><br />This RFT applies to concrete footpaths only. Pavers, asphalt, shared paths, kerb and gutter, driveways and decorative finishes are excluded.<br /><br />This specification details the provision of concrete grinding to SSC’s footpath assets. The scope of work comprises of creating a safe pedestrian thoroughfare by grinding displacements in concrete footpaths. The displacements range between 5mm to 30mm in height.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sutherland Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 20/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531539<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
