<item><title>ITO - Analytical and Laboratory Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Seqwater is seeking a suitably qualified Service Provider to deliver analytical, laboratory and transport services to support water quality and environmental monitoring across its waterways, treatment plants and bulk water networks.<br /><br />The core scope includes the supply of sample containers and prepacking, courier transport, sample receipt and processing, laboratory analysis, electronic data delivery, reporting, exceedance notifications, dedicated account management, technical support and customer service. The Service Provider must also provide 24/7/365 support and emergency response capability.<br /><br />An optional separable portion covers services associated with Seqwater’s Bulk Chemical Testing Program.<br /><br />Seqwater reserves the right, at its sole discretion, to award each separable portion independently and to different Service Providers. Tenderers may submit a response for the core scope, the optional separable portion, or both.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Seqwater<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Dec/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531547<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Chemicals, Biochemical, Gas, Lab, Measure, Observe & Test Equip<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
