<item><title>RFT CT2027021 Gregadoo Waste Management Centre - Extraction Pumps Renewal and Maintenance</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Project Name<br /><br />Gregadoo Waste Management Centre Extraction Pumps Renewal & Maintenance<br /><br />Project Location<br /><br />132 Ashfords Road, Gregadoo NSW 2650<br /><br />Description<br /><br />The project involves the design, supply, installation, commissioning, maintenance and servicing of nine replacement leachate and groundwater extraction pumps at the Gregadoo Waste Management Centre (GWMC). The works include removal of existing pumps and associated equipment, installation of new pumps with electrical, communications, solar and battery systems, integration with Council’s SCADA network, testing and commissioning, provision of operations and maintenance documentation, and ongoing maintenance for an initial two-year period with options for extension. The project aims to improve the reliability, performance and long-term management of leachate and groundwater extraction systems at the facility.<br /><br />Contract Term<br /><br />The Contract comprises the design, supply, installation and commiss...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Wagga Wagga City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531524<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Gas Energy, Infrastructure, Equipment, Mechanical Plant, Equip, Services, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
