<item><title>RFT2627-14 Adobe Software Renewal</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Town of Port Hedland (Town) currently maintains Adobe software subscriptions under the Adobe Value Incentive Plan (VIP). The Town’s current VIP membership is at Discount Level 4 and Transaction Tier 1, and the existing licensing expires on 23 November 2026.<br /><br />The Town is seeking an authorised Adobe reseller to provide an initial three-year renewal of its existing Adobe software subscriptions, with the option for two further one-year renewals at the sole discretion of the Town. <br /><br />The objective of the procurement is to maintain uninterrupted access to the Town’s existing Adobe products while obtaining transparent pricing and efficient renewal administration.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Town of Port Hedland<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 11/Nov/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+08:00) Perth time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531322<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
