<item><title>Maranda Heights Playground Installation</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council are seeking the design and construction of a new playground in the Maranda Heights Estate, located in the township of Emerald, Queensland. <br /><br />This Request for Quote allows for creative input into designing a playful, engaging and vibrant play destination, promoting a strong sense of community, bringing all age groups together in one space. It must inspire and encourage interaction and cooperation as children learn to play together.<br /><br />To improve safety, comfort and usability for families year-round, quotes are also being sought for the supply and installation of a permanent shade structure for the new playground.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Central Highlands Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Nov/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531270<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Sport, Recreation Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
