<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> To engage a service provider to deliver a Youth Mental Health Promotion Program in secondary schools in the Macedon Ranges Shire. The program will equip young people with practical mental health knowledge, skills and support networks through evidence-informed, youth-centred education. It will also build the capacity of adults who work with young people, including teachers, school staff, youth workers and community leaders to recognise, support and promote positive mental health outcomes.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Macedon Ranges Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531231<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Community & Social Services, Healthcare Services, HR Services & Recruitment<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
