<item><title>RFT260109 Rolleston WTP and WWTP Chlorination Systems</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Background Information<br /><br />Central Highlands Regional Council (CHRC) is seeking new gas chlorination systems at Rolleston WTP, Rolleston WWTP, Dame St WTP Springsure and Twin Tanks WTP Springsure. The works are divided into four (4) Separable Portions, with the requirements and price for each site identified separately. <br /><br />The chlorination packages will differ in size, capacity, operating requirements and site arrangements. Each Separable Portion will have its own design and performance specification. Tenderers must assess each site individually. <br /><br />3.1 Purpose of the early tender release <br /><br />Council is releasing this RFT while the site designs are progressing. The 50% design for Rolleston WTP is included with the initial release. This early release gives suppliers time to understand the project, prepare their tender approach, begin consultation with manufacturers and specialist subcontractors, and get ready for the remaining Separable Portions. <br /><br />Tenderers should us...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Central Highlands Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530253<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 13]]></description>
