<item><title>Request for Information: Dental Equipment Maintenance</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Requests for Information (RFI) only.<br /><br />The Customer has issued this RFI with the objectives of: <br /><br />•	gathering market information to support future planning for dental equipment maintenance services;<br /><br />•	understanding the capability of suppliers to provide maintenance services for dental equipment;<br /><br />•	identifying the equipment types, makes and models that suppliers can support;<br /><br />•	understanding supplier service coverage across Hospital and Health Services, facilities, metropolitan, regional and remote locations;<br /><br />•	understanding workforce capacity, including technician numbers, qualifications and locations; and<br /><br />•	This RFI is not intended to be used to select or shortlist suppliers.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queensland Health<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 10/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530535<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Mahamat Hamid Bechir Email: mahamat.bechir@health.qld.gov.au Tel: (07) 3542 5853<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Healthcare Services, Medical Equipment. & Supplies<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
