<item><title>Jack Cooper Reserve Playspace</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The project, located at Hibbard Dr Hillier, includes the construction and delivery of a new playspace and irrigation along with minor earthworks. The project includes the installation of proprietary play equipment, nature play elements such as a waterplay creek and sandpit, rockwork, new furniture, hardstand and softfall surfacing, a shade sail, and associated landscaping, including new turf, irrigation connected to the existing system, trees and garden beds.<br /><br />A site briefing will be held at 10am on Monday 9th November 2026.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Town of Gawler<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 25/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+09:30) Adelaide time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531039<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Katelyn Diprose Email: katelyn.diprose@gawler.sa.gov.au Tel: 0427292865<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
