<item><title>Provision of Power Supply for Stuarts Point Sewer Scheme</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Kempsey Shire Council is seeking submission from appropriately qualified and experienced suppliers for the design, supply and installation of permanent power supplies for the Stuarts Point STP, Fishermans Reach Flushing Station and Grassy Head Pump Station.<br /><br />Council has prepared preliminary concept designs and load calculations for each site. Construction works on the Stuarts Point STP are scheduled to commence in February 2027. Temporary power supplied by Council for early STP construction, however timely delivery of the permanent power supply is required to minimise cost and improve reliability associated with temporary generator power supplies.<br /><br />Refer to the Tender Documents available for download for details of scope and further information.<br /><br />A mandatory pre-tender briefing and site inspection is held on Tuesday 03 November 2026, starting 11.00am.<br /><br />This is held at the STP Site, corner of Fisherman Reach Road and Tea Tree Trail, 700m south of 19th Avenue.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Kempsey Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 17/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP531003<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services, Electronic Components & Supplies<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 12]]></description>
