<item><title>PAH Mental Health Anti-Ligature Project</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Princess Alexandra Hospital (PAH) is seeking a Principal Contractor to deliver anti-ligature refurbishment, and upgrade works within Mental Health Services wards located in Building 19 and Building 7 (Grevillea Ward). The works include upgrades to doors, fixtures, fittings, accessibility elements, ventilation grilles, and associated building services. Works will be undertaken within an operational healthcare facility and include all associated construction, commissioning, certification, and handover requirements. Location: PAH, Woolloongabba, QLD. Timing to be confirmed during the procurement process.<br /><br />For more information, please refer to attached documentation.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Metro South Hospital and Health Service<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Nov/2026 11:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530984<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 10]]></description>
