<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Banana Shire Council invites tenders from suitably qualified contractors for the wet hire of a Grader (with final trim operator) and Water Truck to work with the Theodore Construction Crew on their Capital Works projects as described in more detail in Part 5 – Scope. The contract will be for a preferred supplier arrangement for a single contractor over a period of 2 years with a possible 1-year extension.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Banana Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 20/Nov/2026 11:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530996<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Plant & Equipment - Hire<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
