<item><title>West Moreton Bridge Renewal Stage 2</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Queensland Rail is seeking to engage a Principal Contractor to deliver the West Moreton Bridge Renewal Stage 2 Project under a Design & Construct (D&C) delivery model. The project involves the replacement of four existing timber rail bridges at two locations on the Rosewood to Toowoomba section of the West Moreton System, at chainages 56.600 km and 59.230 km.<br /><br />The works will broadly include the design and construction of new concrete ballast deck bridges, demolition of the existing structures, associated track, formation, drainage and access works, and testing, certification and handover. The works will be delivered within a live operational rail environment and will require construction planning and staging to accommodate rail possession and access constraints<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queensland Rail<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 04/Dec/2026 11:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530975<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Dayne Liebelt Email: dayne.liebelt@qr.com.au Tel: (07) 3096 0924<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
