<item><title>Q26/118 - Controls Manager</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Controls Manager will lead portfolio controls across the FRP, providing reliable project and financial reporting, forecasts and analysis that help leaders make timely decisions. The role will establish consistent controls, manage a team of analysts, identify delivery and financial risks, and support compliant, value-for-money outcomes for Council and the community.<br /><br />Please refer to Position Description.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Lismore City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Nov/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530985<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Management Advisory Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
