<item><title>RFT 24.26 Stormwater Drainage Pit Upgrade Works</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Shire of Ashburton (Shire, Principal) is seeking an experienced suitably qualified contractor to undertake stormwater drainage pit upgrade works within Tom Price. The works include the removal of existing stormwater pit grates, saw cutting of adjacent kerbing and asphalt pavement, installation of Shire-supplied grated side entry lintels, backfilling and compaction around the new lintels, reconstruction and tie-in of kerbing, reinstatement of asphalt pavement, and all associated works necessary to provide a complete and functional stormwater pit upgrade. A full statement of the goods/services required under the proposed Contract appears in Part 3: Specification.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Shire of Ashburton<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+08:00) Perth time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530916<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
