<item><title>ITT2617 Supply and Installation of Chillers Caloundra Indoor Stadium</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council is seeking an experienced Principal contractor to undertake the disposal and replacement of the existing chiller plant system, including cooling tower upgrades and associated mechanical services located at the Caloundra Indoor Stadium.<br /><br />The project includes testing and commissioning of a new mechanical solution.<br /><br />The works will also include the replacement and upgrade of the main switchboard responsible for managing the facility's electrical power supply, ensuring compatibility with the new plant and improving overall system reliability and performance.<br /><br />Respondents are able to nominate alternate equivalent equipment to that specified in the Tender. Respondents must complete Schedule 6 Appendix 3 System Components as part of the tender response.<br /><br />This is a lump sum contract. The successful Contractor will provide all equipment and services required to complete the project.<br /><br />A non-mandatory Information Session will be held on 3 November 2026, refer to d...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 17/Nov/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP529921<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services, Mechanical Plant, Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 17]]></description>
