<item><title>1576-2026 -EOI Provision, Installation &amp; Operation of Electric Vehicle (EV) Charging Infrastructure</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council is seeking Expressions of Interest (EOI) from suitably qualified charge point operators (CPOs) interested in installing, operating and maintaining public electric vehicle (EV) charging infrastructure at Council-owned sites across the municipality.<br /><br />Council has identified eight potential sites for the installation of public EV charging infrastructure. Respondents may nominate one or more of these sites and may also propose alternative sites within Banyule for Council’s consideration.<br /><br />Council’s preferred approach is to facilitate the commercial rollout of public EV charging infrastructure through an agreement with successful respondents. Under the proposed arrangement, successful respondents will be responsible for funding, installing, operating and maintaining the charging infrastructure for the agreed term, and will pay Council an annual fee for each approved site, in accordance with the final agreement.<br /><br />Respondents are invited to outline their proposed sites, charging ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Banyule City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Nov/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530675<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services, Fleet Servicing & Accessories<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
