<item><title>T27017 - Waste Collection and Transport Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Contract No. T27017 – Waste Collection Services<br /><br />Tenders are invited for the provision of Waste Collection and Transport Services. Council is seeking detailed submissions from suitably qualified and experienced contractors for two primary Contract packages: Waste Collection Services for general rubbish (Contract A) and Waste Collection Services for Food Organics Garden Organics (FOGO) (Contract B).<br /><br />Tenderers may submit a Tender for Contract A, Contract B, or both. <br /><br />A Tender Briefing will be held on Wednesday 4 November 2026 at 3:30pm, please refer to the RFT documents for further details.<br /><br />NOTE: The Vendor Panel online forum closes 10 business days prior to the abovementioned tender closing date. Council reserves the right not to accept the lowest or any Tender, or part thereof. Tenders received after the closing time will not be considered.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Stonnington<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 17/Dec/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530897<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Waste Management & Landfill<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
