<item><title>EVENT &amp; NON-EVENT SECURITY SERVICES - The Gabba, QSAC &amp; Sleeman Sports Complex</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Stadiums Queensland (SQ) invites Offers for the provision of event and non-event security services at The Gabba, Queensland Sport and Athletics Centre (QSAC) and Sleeman Sports Complex (SSC).<br /><br />This procurement has been divided into two separately awardable portions because the venues have different operating profiles.<br /><br />Separable Portion 1 covers The Gabba, a major stadium used for national and international sport and other major events.<br /><br />Separable Portion 2 covers Queensland Sport and Athletics Centre (QSAC) and Sleeman Sports Complex (SSC), which host elite, national and international sport while also supporting substantial community, school, training and day-to-day public use.<br /><br />Across both portions, SQ is seeking security services that are safe, professional, customer-focused and flexible, and capable of scaling to the operational demands of each venue.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Stadiums Queensland<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 10/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530903<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Security Services & Equipment<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 15]]></description>
