<item><title>Minor &amp; Major Civil Works Panel</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This tender is for the establishment of a panel of pre-qualified suppliers / contractors for the undertaking Minor & Major Civil Works at various locations within the MidCoast Council Local Government Area as part of Council's operations. This contract is to compliment Council's various panel contracts to enable Council to implement its Delivery Program and Operational Plan effectively.<br /><br />Works shall include but not be limited to; bulk earthworks, construction of road pavement, stormwater drainage, concreting works, sediment and erosion control, landscaping, retaining walls, fencing, and signposting.<br /><br />Council invites tenders for MCC-26-334204 for undertaking Minor & Major Civil Works at various locations within MidCoast Council for a period of 3 years with two 12-month options that can be activated by Council.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> MidCoast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 17/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530876<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services, Environmental & Heritage Services, Horticulture & Arboriculture, Utilities<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
