<item><title>Inala Centre of Excellence Louvre Replacement Project</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Metro South Hospital and Health Service seeks a suitably qualified contractor to design, supply, install, commission, and certify a replacement operable louvre system, or propose a suitable and compliant alternative solution. <br /><br />The intent of the project is to:<br /><br />•	Replace the existing damaged & non-functioning operable louvre system.<br /><br />•	An increased level of durability with the new solution.<br /><br />•	Ensure compliance to all relevant standards, codes, and legislation.<br /><br />•	Provide an appropriate long-term and low maintenance solution for the building environment and condition. <br /><br />•	Improve the overall appearance of the building façade within the scope of the project.<br /><br />•	Reduce the risk to staff, patients, and members of the public due to projectile hazards and slips/trips/falls along external staff walkway.<br /><br />Expected project completion by 30 June 2027.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Metro South Hospital and Health Service<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530792<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 14]]></description>
