<item><title>The Hub Fire Compliance Services Upgrade</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Livingstone Shire Council invites tenders from suitably qualified and licensed contractors for Tender 2026.060 – The Hub Fire Compliance Services Upgrade.<br /><br />The project comprises upgrades to the fire detection and alarm systems at The Hub, which accommodates commercial tenancies on the ground floor and offices on Levels 1 and 2, together with associated improvements to the ground-floor foyer entry. The works comprise the detailed design, supply, installation, connection, testing and commissioning of a complete fire detection and alarm system, including associated electrical works and monitoring connections.<br /><br />The scope also includes replacing the ground-floor foyer entry doors with an automatic sliding door integrated with the new fire panel and existing access control system, associated building modifications, making good and certification. All works are to be delivered in accordance with the nominated engineering specifications, drawings and applicable standards, within the specified site ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Livingstone Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 12/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530770<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Fire & Safety<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 23]]></description>
