<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The University of Queensland (UQ) seeks offers for the supply of Pool Plant Preventative Maintenance, Corrective Maintenance and Operational Support Services across both the St Lucia and Gatton campuses.<br /><br />UQ Sport operates a range of aquatic facilities that rely on the ongoing performance, reliability and compliance of complex plant and equipment. To support the safe and efficient operation of these facilities, UQ Sport seeks to establish a long-term partnership with a suitably qualified contractor capable of delivering reliable, proactive and accountable maintenance services. The successful contractor will provide high-quality maintenance while working collaboratively with UQ Sport to identify and implement opportunities to improve plant reliability, operational efficiency, energy performance, regulatory compliance and asset longevity. Through expert advice, practical solutions and ongoing operational support, the contractor will contribute to continuous improvement initiatives and the effective lo...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> The University of Queensland<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530752<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Cleaning Services, Equip, Supplies, Mechanical Plant, Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
