<item><title>2027/341 Myall Street and Boobook Avenue Intersection Upgrade</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Mildura Rural City Council is seeking Tender responses from suitably qualified contractors to undertake civil construction works associated with the Myall Street and Boobook Avenue Intersection Upgrade. This will include demolition and site preparation works, construction of new traffic island, road widening and associated pavement works, installation of signage, localised earthworks and reinstatement works, and post-project site clean-up in accordance with the Drawings and Specifications.<br /><br />ENQUIRIES: Any tender enquiries should be directed to the online forum in VendorPanel.<br /><br />SUBMISSIONS: Completed responses can ONLY be submitted electronically by uploading into the VendorPanel System. Respondents will receive a confirmation email response upon completion. Should assistance be required please use the help function or the online chat available from the home page of VendorPanel.<br /><br />Submissions must be fully received by the closing time as late submissions will not be accepted. Counc...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Mildura Rural City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530676<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
