<item><title>MidCoast Council Community Buildings Pest Management Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> MidCoast Council invites suitably qualified and experienced contractors to tender for the provision of pest management services across approximately 300 community buildings. These buildings are located throughout the MidCoast local government area on the NSW Mid North Coast. Tenderers must demonstrate the capability and capacity to service all buildings identified in the Returnable Schedule across the entire local government area.<br /><br />The contract covers scheduled general pest inspections and treatments, authorised termite services, rodent management, reactive call outs and emergency services.<br /><br />Services must be delivered by appropriately licensed personnel using safe, compliant and integrated pest management practices, with digital reporting provided for each site visit. The contract is expected to commence in January 2027, subject to Council endorsement.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> MidCoast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Nov/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530524<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Kris Koch Email: kristine.koch@midcoast.nsw.gov.au Tel: 79557359<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint.<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.com.au/tsi.axd?id=d2182647ce6147bfba6deae8f9e2745bs530524s86939366ab6046bc956fc34a397b1db5s1547</link>
