<item><title>Werril Street Traffic Calming and Speed Reduction</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Swan Hill Rural City Council invites suitably qualified and experienced Tenderers to submit a Tender for the delivery of the Werril Street Traffic Calming and Speed Reduction Works in Swan Hill.<br /><br />The successful Tenderer will be responsible for the construction and delivery of the traffic calming and Local Area Traffic Management (LATM) works, including:<br /><br />•	Raised safety platforms.<br /><br />•	Splitter islands and kerb realignments.<br /><br />•	Two-way slow points.<br /><br />•	Footpath construction and pavement works.<br /><br />•	Signage, line marking, and associated civil works.<br /><br />Council is seeking a contractor with demonstrated experience in delivering road safety and traffic calming projects within live traffic environments. The successful Tenderer will be expected to deliver the works safely, efficiently, and in accordance with Council's specifications, DTP requirements, and the prescribed funding timeframe for the Safe Local Roads and Streets Program.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Swan Hill Rural City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530638<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Signs & Barriers<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
