<item><title>Footpath and Drainage Construction – Colches Street, Farley Street &amp; Jersey Street, Casino</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This tender has been called to engage a suitably qualified and experienced contractor to complete all works outlined in the scope of works as per the attached detailed plans and bill of quantities for the footpath and drainage construction on Colches Street, Farley Street & Jersey Street, Casino.<br /><br />The scope of works includes but is not limited to:<br /><br />•	Consult with affected property owners two weeks in advance via a letter box drop and/or door knock. <br /><br />•	Dial Before You Dig – locate and pothole (if required) underground services<br /><br />•	Survey works to be located and protected prior to starting<br /><br />•	Highlight overhead electrical wires<br /><br />•	Establish on site and install sediment controls.<br /><br />•	Implement Pedestrian and Traffic Management Plan<br /><br />•	Lower water mains under location of new box culvert and existing stormwater pipe<br /><br />•	Remove existing concrete as defined on plans in the vicinity of Dean Street<br /><br />•	Install flushing poi...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Richmond Valley Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 12/Nov/2026 10:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528577<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 12]]></description>
