<item><title>EOI - Facilities Management</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Whiddon is issuing this request for information and expressions of interest (RFI/EOI) to parties interested in <br /><br />participating in a planned future request for tender (RFT) process to appoint one or more head contractors to <br /><br />deliver facilities maintenance services under new contractual arrangements. <br /><br />The objectives of this RFI/EOI are to:<br /><br />(a) Inform the refinement of the planned RFT, including the services to be included, contracting model, <br /><br />pricing model, and performance management framework;<br /><br />(b) Assess the capability, capacity, and experience of interested parties; and<br /><br />(c) Shortlist potentially suitable contractors for the RFT process<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Whiddon<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530565<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Affan Shoaib Email: a.shoaib@whiddon.com.au Tel: 02 98276652<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Real Estate & Property Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
