<item><title>RFT2627-13 Marapikurrinya Park Playground Replacement</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Town of Port Hedland is seeking an experienced and suitably qualified Contractor to replace the playground and softfall equipment at Marapikurrinya Park in Port Hedland.<br /><br />The current play equipment and softfall at Marapikurrinya Park was installed in 2017 and has reached the end of its useful asset life. <br /><br />Given the playground’s close proximity to the ocean and as the site has been well utilised, corrosion and deterioration is evident on the equipment and surfaces. <br /><br />The existing playground and softfall footprint is approximately 250m2.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Town of Port Hedland<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 13/Nov/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+08:00) Perth time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530472<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Furniture & Furnishings, Horticulture & Arboriculture, Sport, Recreation Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 13]]></description>
