<item><title>Expression of Interest Snowy River Hostel</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Snowy Monaro Regional Council (SMRC) owns the Snowy River Hostel at 7 Jindalee St, Berridale. The site includes Lot 3 DP261695, Lot 3 DP801367 and Lot 10 DP1130244. The Snowy River Hostel (SRH) was a 14-bed aged care facility however was closed on 28 March 2024. Since then, the building has been vacant and currently not utilised. SMRC is seeking Expressions of Interest from suitably qualified organisations to provide Council with proposals to use the Snowy SRH site for community purposes.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Snowy Monaro Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 11/Nov/2026 10:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530451<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Community & Social Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
