<item><title>T2027-05 Ausgrid HV Augmentation Works for the Apex Park Redevelopment Project</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The purpose of the project is to carry out early works to support the redevelopment of Apex Park Cessnock.<br /><br />The project is being funded from contributions by the Commonwealth via the Regional Precincts and Partnerships Program (rPPP).The redevelopment consists of:<br /><br />•	Naturalization to the drainage channel<br /><br />•	Landscaping and cultural artwork<br /><br />•	Carparking, lighting, shelters and footpaths<br /><br />Provide a Lump Sum Tender for the works detailed within the Contract Documentation which may be generally described as the Apex Park – Ausgrid HV augmentation and associated works.<br /><br />The Contract Documentation includes Electrical Design documents, Geotechnical Reports, Survey, Services information, Preliminaries, Australian Standards and Codes of Practice. <br /><br />PRE TENDER MEETING: Wednesday, 28 October 2026 at 1pm - Apex Park Cessnock<br /><br />TENDER DEADLINE DATE: Wednesday 11th November 2026 at 2pm<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Cessnock City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 11/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP529612<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 14]]></description>
