<item><title>Dive Compressor Replacement at MSAC</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The purpose of this project is the planned, like-for-like replacement of aging, end-of-life mechanical assets for the dive pool sparger system and its accompanying cycling dryer. <br /><br />The project scope includes the complete removal, supply, installation, testing, and commissioning of dive pool sparger air compressors and associated equipment.<br /><br />All replacements are to be like-for-like, ensuring:<br /><br />•	Match and verify electrical Infrastructure<br /><br />•	Mechanical compatibility with existing infrastructure.<br /><br />•	Minimal modification to existing pipework, supports, and controls.<br /><br />•	Proper bypass system is in place<br /><br />•	Validate plant room ventilation and ambient airflow is suitable <br /><br />•	Vibration management<br /><br />•	Correct placement of condensate drains<br /><br />•	Pipe sizing for any new components is suitable <br /><br />It will also deliver a comprehensive three-year service plan.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> State Sport Centres Trust<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530235<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Gas Energy, Infrastructure, Equipment, Mechanical Plant, Equip, Services, Plant & Equipment - Purchase<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
