<item><title>Sport &amp; Recreation Grounds Maintenance Services Panel</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Tamworth Regional Council is seeking to establish a panel of suitably qualified contractors to provide sport and recreation grounds maintenance and vegetation management services across Council facilities throughout the Tamworth Regional Local Government Area. Services may include mowing, brush cutting, edging, vegetation trimming, herbicide application, weed control, event preparation, general grounds maintenance and associated labour and plant services.<br /><br />The panel arrangement will operate for an initial term of twelve (12) months and will remain open to new contractors throughout the contract term. Contractors may apply for Grounds Maintenance Services, Chemical Application Services, or both service categories.<br /><br />There is no guarantee of any minimum volume, frequency or value of work. Work will be allocated at Council's discretion based on factors including availability, capability, performance, response times, experience and value for money.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Tamworth Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 10/Nov/2026 11:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530136<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Horticulture & Arboriculture<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
