<item><title>201242 HVAC Installation &amp; Maintenance</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council is seeking to establish a panel of suitably qualified and experienced contractors to provide Heating, Ventilation and Air Conditioning (HVAC) installation, maintenance, repair and associated mechanical services across Council’s asset portfolio. The panel will be utilised on a scheduled and as-required basis to support both operational and capital works programs, including planned preventative maintenance, reactive repairs, minor and major installations, replacements, upgrades, refurbishments and system renewals.<br /><br />The panel will be utilised to deliver HVAC maintenance, repair, installation, replacement and upgrade works across Council’s asset portfolio, including administration buildings, community facilities, libraries, sporting facilities, depots and public amenities. Services may include inspections, testing, fault finding, commissioning, emergency call-outs, BMS integration, energy efficiency improvements and associated engineering, compliance and project support services.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sutherland Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530116<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Mechanical Plant, Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
