<item><title>1574-2026 - Petrie Park Playground Renewal</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council is seeking tenders from suitably qualified contractors for the supply and installation of playground equipment, and the delivery of associated landscape construction works for the Petrie Park Playground Upgrade in Montmorency.<br /><br />Petrie Park is a valued local neighbourhood park located in Montmorency, providing play, recreation and informal gathering opportunities for the surrounding community. As part of Council's ongoing playground renewal program, the existing playground is being upgraded to ensure it continues to meet contemporary standards, community expectations, and the recreational needs of residents and visitors to the park. The project aims to deliver a renewed, accessible and engaging play space that enhances play value, supports a range of ages and abilities, and integrates with the park's existing landscape setting.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Banyule City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Nov/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP530063<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Sport, Recreation Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
