<item><title>Expression of Interest (EOI): Social Procurement Supplier Register</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Woollahra Municipal Council (Council) invites Expressions of Interest (EOI) from suitably qualified suppliers seeking inclusion on Council's Social Procurement Supplier Register.<br /><br />The Register will help Council identify suppliers that deliver positive social, economic and community outcomes, including, but not limited to, First Nations businesses, social enterprises, disability enterprises, diverse-owned businesses, community benefit organisations and local businesses based and operating in Woollahra Municipal Council. <br /><br />The Register is intended to provide Council with a pool of suppliers that may be considered for low-value procurement opportunities across a range of goods, services and minor works categories.<br /><br />Inclusion on the Register does not guarantee any work, expenditure or invitation to quote.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Woollahra Municipal Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Dec/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP529084<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Advertising and Media Services, Architecture, Design, Planning, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Catering & Hospitality, Clothing & Safety Equipment, ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services, Mechanical Plant, Equip, Services, Printing & Distribution Services, Signs & Barriers<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
