<item><title>Sale or Lease of Property 47-49 Wotton Street Wiluna WA 6646</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Shire of Wiluna is seeking Expressions of Interest (EOI) by way of Tenders from parties interested in the Sale or Lease of Property at 47- 49 Wotton Street, Wiluna. The Shire of Wiluna has determined that the property is surplus to its requirements. The subject property occupies a very central location at the heart of the town’s commercial precinct and has been used: as a community meeting space, community development program space, to accommodate community events and more lately as an occasional office. There are two office/multi-use buildings on site, with a shade structure covering the area between the two buildings. There is a large rear yard on each parcel of land, with access from the rear laneway. Under the Shire of Wiluna :Local Planning Scheme No.2 the land is zoned Commercial. <br /><br />Each Lot is 1012 m2. Most of the buildings and Shade Structure are within Lot 36 being 47 Wotton Street, with the northern building structure partly straddling the legal dividing boundary between the two parcel...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Shire of Wiluna<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 06/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+08:00) Perth time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP529953<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Aircraft & Aviation Services, Building Products & Materials, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Community & Social Services, Construction & Operation, ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services, Environmental & Heritage Services, Hardware & Hand Tools, Healthcare Services, Training & Development, Transport, Freight, Logistics, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
