<item><title>Ken Harrison Reserve - Irrigation Upgrade Works</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Swan Hill Rural City Council invites suitably qualified and experienced contractors to submit a tender for the design and construction of an irrigation system upgrade at Ken Harrison Reserve, Swan Hill, Victoria.<br /><br />The project is time sensitive considering the seasonality of cricket and other sports activities in the vicinity.<br /><br />This Contract will be a Lump Sum Contract not subjected to market price adjustments and will be governed in accordance with the Australian Standard 4902:2000, a standard form contract in Australia for design and construction projects.<br /><br />The overall project scope comprises of:<br /><br />•	Pump Shed Design, required permits/consents, and construction<br /><br />•	Decommissioning of the old pump shed and existing pump pit<br /><br />•	Supply and install Pump System with suitable pumps<br /><br />•	Upgradation of the irrigation system for the Cricket Oval including the control system<br /><br />•	Providing required suction infrastructure to draw water from the ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Swan Hill Rural City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 26/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP529859<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Horticulture & Arboriculture, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
