<item><title>PTM and SHS services for Wellington Road, East Brisbane</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Housing and Public Works is seeking to procure suppliers to provide Property and Tenancy Management Services and Specialist Homelessness Services for Wellington Road, East Brisbane. <br /><br />Construction is underway on two adjoining blocks of land in East Brisbane, which will deliver two interconnected residential buildings, one facing Wellington Road and the other facing Kennedy Terrace.<br /><br />The Wellington Road tower, designed for families, will be managed by a Registered Community Housing Provider (RCHP), who will deliver the property and tenancy management services for 40 units of social housing, of which 20 will be utilised for delivery of Supportive Housing. The RCHP will also manage the office space, common areas and underground onsite parking within the tower and provide onsite security.<br /><br />A Specialist Homelessness Service provider will deliver onsite support and case management for 20 families under Supportive Housing and will provide a 24/7 onsite concierge servic...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Housing and Public Works<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Nov/2026 10:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP529856<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Louise Carmody Email: louise.carmody@hpw.qld.gov.au Tel: 07 30074412<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Community & Social Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 13]]></description>
