<item><title>Provision of a Computerised Maintenance Management System for Facilities Maintenance Operations</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Queensland Parliamentary Service (QPS) seeks the provision and implementation of a commercially available, purpose-built Facilities Maintenance (FM) - Computerised Maintenance Management System (CMMS). The proposed CMMS must provide comprehensive facilities and asset management functionality, including asset lifecycle management, planned and reactive maintenance, work order management, contractor management, mobile workforce capability, compliance and statutory maintenance management, reporting, dashboards, and full audit trail functionality.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queensland Parliament: Parliamentary Service<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP529754<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
