<item><title>Consumables - Corrugated Target System</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> As the Managing Contractor for Integrated Land Target System (ILTS) Program, ATS will be responsible for the procurement, delivery into service, inventory management, replenishment and sustainment (where applicable) Corrugated Target System Consumable products for the Department of Defence (Defence). <br /><br />The Integrated Land Target System (ILTS) Program defines a means by which Defence can improve, modernise and enhance land combatant training outcomes through contemporary and fit for purpose target systems and Consumables, managed and sustained under the Program.<br /><br />This Statement of Requirement (SOR) defines the requirement for the establishment of a Standing Offer for the supply of the Corrugated Target System Consumable products in support of Army training activities. This Corrugate Target System comprises of target board and decal products. The products to be supplied are used on Defence training ranges to enable the safe, realistic and effective conduct of live-fire weapons training. The ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Australian Target Systems<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 05/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP526893<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Defence & Law Enforcement, Indust. Production, Manufacturing<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 12]]></description>
