<item><title>Engineering and Technical Services Panels (Primary and Niche) Expression of Interest</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Seqwater invites Expression of Interest (EOI) from suitably qualified and experienced suppliers for the establishment of its Engineering & Technical Services Panel(s). <br /><br />The proposed arrangements comprise two panels: <br /><br />Primary Panel: Multidisciplinary engineering and consultancy services supporting the planning, design and delivery of water infrastructure projects, including dams, weirs, networks and water treatment assets. <br /><br />Niche Panel: Specialist technical and advisory services across catchments, modelling and pipeline protection, and discipline-specific engineering and consultancy services. <br /><br />The panels will support Seqwater's ongoing operational requirements and significant capital investment program across Southeast Queensland. <br /><br />Respondents may nominate for either or both panels and one or multiple service categories, subject to meeting the applicable mandatory requirements.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Seqwater<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 12/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP526028<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Patrick Ruddy Email: patrick.ruddy@seqwater.com.au Tel: 0433501659<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Engineer, Research, Tech services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
