<item><title>CT2027009 Tertiary Filter Media Replacement</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council invites tenders from suitably qualified and experienced contractors for the supply, installation and refurbishment of tertiary filter media at the Narrung Street and Kooringal Wastewater Treatment Plants (WWTPs).<br /><br />The works include replacement of filter media within four tertiary filter cells at Narrung Street WWTP and three tertiary filter cells at Kooringal WWTP, together with refurbishment works required to restore the filters to near-new operating condition.<br /><br />The contract will be awarded as a single Supply and Install Contract. Tenderers shall provide all labour, materials, plant, equipment, supervision, testing and commissioning necessary to complete the works.<br /><br />Refer to RFT documentation for more information.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Wagga Wagga City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 13/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP529186<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 10]]></description>
