<item><title>Council Managed Caravan Park - Fire Safety Works - BEMM RIVER AND OMEO</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> East Gippsland Shire Council requires fire safety upgrades at Omeo Holiday Park and Bemm River Caravan Park to bring the operational caravan parks into compliance with the 2024 CFA guidelines. The current park operations and fire protection arrangements are based on previous regulatory requirements and must be reviewed and upgraded to meet current fire safety expectations. The works require the design and construction of upgraded fire hydrant systems, supported by a site master plan that addresses internal road access, fire appliance access, hydrant coverage, emergency access, separation distances and adequate park spacing in accordance with the 2024 CFA guidelines. The ECM drawings are performance/reference information only; the Contractor is responsible for completing and certifying the detailed design under AS 4902.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> East Gippsland Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 11/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP529396<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Fire & Safety<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
