<item><title>Expressions of Interest - Panel for Supervision of Construction Activities</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Blue Mountains City Council through this Expression of Interest (EOI), is seeking the services of suitably qualified service providers interested in being placed on a Panel to provide a range of Project Management Services. This Panel will assist in delivering major grant funded projects primarily funded by the Western Sydney Infrastructure Grants Program, but potentially other major grant funded projects as well. This panel will be used to provide additional project management capacity from 1 January 2027 to 31 December 2028, with the majority of work expected to be from mid-January 2027 to December 2027.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Blue Mountains City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 03/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528912<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Engineer, Research, Tech services, HR Services & Recruitment, Management Advisory Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
