<item><title>WT20-25/26 Construction of Greenmount to Nobby Trunk Water Main</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The proposed Greenmount to Nobby Trunk Water Main (G2N) is part of the Four Communities Program of work being delivered by Toowoomba Regional Council (Council) as part of the Toowoomba to Warwick Pipeline Project (T2WP). The goal of the T2WP Project is to provide water security to Council and the Southern Downs Regional Council (SDRC) areas. <br /><br />Council requires the construction of approximately 7.5 km of an underground DN 200 potable trunk water main between Greenmount and Nobby (G2N). The trunk main commences at a tee located on the Greenmount to Cambooya (G2C) trunk water main and ends at the elevated water reservoir in the Nobby township. The G2N main includes a tee within the Nobby township that will serve as the commencement of the future Nobby to Clifton (N2C) trunk water main.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Toowoomba Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 03/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528852<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 22]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.com.au/tsi.axd?id=47f75b876e2e42a087b5b3bd2e65b690s528852s786e232eacbb4e31b23c50bf234a0226s1611</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">47f75b876e2e42a087b5b3bd2e65b690</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 19:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Water &amp; Sewage</category>
</item>
<item><title>Interim Caretakers - Maldon Caravan Park</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Mount Alexander Shire Council ("Council") is seeking an experienced contractor to provide short-term management services to assist the operation of the Maldon Caravan Park in Maldon, Victoria. <br /><br />The initial contract term will be five (5) months, commencing 1 February 2027, with a possible three (3) x six (6) month extensions, totalling a possible maximum Contract Term of two (s) years.<br /><br />Maldon Caravan Park ("the Caravan Park") is situated at 11 Hospital Street, Maldon, within walking distance of the town precinct.<br /><br />SITE VISIT (Non-mandatory)<br /><br />Tenderers may attend a site visit to familiarise themselves with the site.<br /><br />Time and Date: 11am, Tuesday 20 October 2026<br /><br />Location: Maldon Caravan Park, 11 Hospital Street Maldon VIC 3463<br /><br />RSVP:	Please RSVP your attendance via email to procurement@mountalexander.vic.gov.au by<br /><br />COB, Monday 19 October 2026<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Mount Alexander Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 06/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528944<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Travel & Tourism<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
