<item><title>Toolooa SHS - Construction - Stage 2 Accessibility Connectivity Works</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Queensland Government is seeking Proposals for Toolooa State High School - Construction - Stage 2 Accessibility Connectivity Works<br /><br />This is a PQC Project.<br /><br />Tenderer please note:<br /><br />Tender documentation and submission for this project is available from the QBuild eTender website (https://etender.hpw.qld.gov.au), Reference number: 96607BLD1<br /><br />All Tenderers must hold a QBCC Licence for either - Low, Medium or Open Building categories to be eligible.<br /><br />Where a PQC requirement is stated, the Principal is not obliged to provide tender documents, consider or accept a tender unless the tenderer is appropriately registered under the Queensland Government's PQC System.<br /><br />NB: If you find you are not eligible, please contact PQC directly on 1800072621 to discuss your registration.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> QBuild<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 10/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528820<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
