<item><title>Preferred Supplier Arrangement (PSA) for the Supply and Delivery of Roadmaking Materials</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Livingstone Shire Council is inviting suitably qualified and experienced suppliers to tender for appointment to a Preferred Supplier Arrangement (PSA) for the Supply and Delivery of Roadmaking Materials.<br /><br />The arrangement will establish a panel of suppliers to support Council’s ongoing road construction, renewal and maintenance programs across the Shire.<br /><br />The requirement includes the supply and, where required, delivery of a range of pavement materials, aggregates, gravel, sand, rock and associated roadmaking materials.<br /><br />Suppliers may tender for one or more material types and supply/delivery options relevant to their capability and are not required to tender for all items.<br /><br />Council may appoint multiple suppliers under the arrangement, with future purchasing having regard to factors including material availability, location, delivery requirements, compliance with applicable specifications and value for money.<br /><br />Interested suppliers are encouraged to review the Te...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Livingstone Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 02/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528691<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
