<item><title>Design and Construction (D&amp;C) of New Social Housing – Palm Island</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Palm Island Aboriginal Shire Council (Council) is seeking to engage one or more suitably qualified and experienced Contractors to undertake the Design and Construction (D&C) of 22 new social housing dwellings across multiple sites on Palm Island, Queensland, together with an optional additional Package comprising two (2) dwellings.<br /><br />The core Works are divided into five (5) Packages, comprising 22 dwellings and 86 bedrooms. An additional Optional Package 6 comprises two (2) dwellings and eight (8) bedrooms. Tenderers may submit a Tender Response for one, several or all Packages, subject to their demonstrated capacity to deliver the Packages tendered. <br /><br />The Contract is intended to provide Council with a turnkey delivery solution, under which the Contractor is responsible for all investigations, design development, engineering, certification, building approvals, procurement, manufacture where applicable, transportation, mobilisation, construction, site and infrastructure works, utility connec...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Palm Island Aboriginal Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528544<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Marcio Fialho Email: marcio.fialho@palmcouncil.qld.gov.au Tel: 0448339292<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Construction & Operation, Engineer, Research, Tech services, Utilities<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 32]]></description>
