<item><title>2026.054 Tree Maintenance Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Mount Barker District Council seeks to engage suitably qualified contractors who are experienced in providing tree maintenance services under three separate works packages as follows:<br /><br />•	Works Package A — Arterial Roads<br /><br />•	Works Package B — Block Pruning<br /><br />•	Works Package C — Planned Tree Maintenance<br /><br />This procurement may result in the award of a single contract with one organization providing all three works packages or three separate agreements with each providing a works package. Tenderers will have the option to tender for any or all of the works packages A, B and C.<br /><br />The Council will enter into an Agreement for these Services with the successful Tenderer for a term of two years with two 12-month optional extensions.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Mount Barker District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 05/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+09:30) Adelaide time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528121<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Daniel Rouse Email: drouse@mountbarker.sa.gov.au Tel: +61 8 8391 7255<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Horticulture & Arboriculture<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 11]]></description>
