<item><title>Coaching and Development Panel</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Queensland Rail invites suitably qualified and experienced suppliers to submit a tender for inclusion on a Coaching & Development Panel.<br /><br />The panel will support Queensland Rail's commitment to developing leadership capability and workforce effectiveness across both operational and corporate environments. Successful suppliers will partner with Queensland Rail to deliver high-quality coaching and professional development services that build organisational capability, support career progression, and enhance leadership effectiveness across the business.<br /><br />The panel arrangement will be established for an initial period of two (2) years, with options to extend at Queensland Rail's discretion.<br /><br />Suppliers may submit proposals for one or both of the following service categories:<br /><br />Category 1: Coaching Services<br /><br />Provision of individual and group coaching services designed to support employees and leaders at various organisational levels, including leadership development, ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queensland Rail<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 13/Nov/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP527407<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Training & Development<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
