<item><title>Bridge Design Program 2026-2027</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The services comprise two separable portions as follows:<br /><br />• Separable Portion A – Design of a heritage compliant replacement for Zeal bridge on Colles Road, Moonlight Flat Castlemaine to rehabilitate Bridge BR003137.<br /><br />• Separable Portion B – Design of a new structure along Metcalfe Taradale Rd over Coliban River Taradale adjacent to Bridge BR003230 (Todds Bridge).<br /><br />Council may award one or both separable portions which will be confirmed prior to contract execution.<br /><br />Mandatory Site Inspections<br /><br />Consultants must attend the mandatory site inspections for the submission to be considered for evaluation. Site inspection information is detailed below:<br /><br />10:30am, Tuesday 13 October 2026<br /><br />Meet at Civic Centre Customer Service - 27 Lyttleton Street, Castlemaine<br /><br />RSVP: procurement@mountalexander.vic.gov.au by COB, Monday 12 October 2026<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Mount Alexander Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 06/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528133<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Engineer, Research, Tech services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
