<item><title>Invitation to Offer - Installation, Testing &amp; Commissioning Services - SCADAPACK 350e Replacements</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Gladstone Area Water Board (GAWB) is seeking a suitable qualified and experienced contractor to undertake stage 1 installation, testing and commissioning services for the SCADAPack 350e replacement project.<br /><br />The Services involve the replacement of 22 existing SCADAPack 350e and 535e RTUs across multiple operational GAWB sites with GAWB supplied SCADAPack 474i RTUs.<br /><br />The SOW includes electrical, installation and modifications, removal and replacement of existing RTUs, associated wiring and terminations, testing, commissioning support, management of site access and planned outages, and completion of required quality and handover documentation.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Gladstone Area Water Board<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 05/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP527140<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services, Indust. Automat'n, Process Control<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 12]]></description>
