<item><title>2027/335 Mildura Landfill Final Capping and Rehabilitation - Design</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Mildura Rural City Council is seeking Tender responses from suitably qualified organisations to provide design and documentation services (Stages 1 and 2) for landfill capping, rehabilitation and transition to Transfer Station operations of Mildura Landfill in compliance with:<br /><br />•	Environment Protection Act 2017 and EPA operating licence conditions<br /><br />•	Operating licence condition OL_L22 (Landfill Rehabilitation Plan)<br /><br />•	Best Practice Environmental Management: Siting, Design, Operation and Rehabilitation of Landfills (EPA Publication 788.3 August 2015 – “Landfill BPEM”)<br /><br />•	Landfill Licensing Guidelines (EPA Publication 1323)<br /><br />•	Environment Reference Standard No. S158 Gazette 29 March 2022<br /><br />For background information on Mildura Landfill refer to appendix 2027-335 Mildura Landfill Background Information.<br /><br />This contract encompasses:<br /><br />•	Stage 1: Assessment, Concept Design and Approvals<br /><br />•	Stage 2: Detailed Design and Tender Doc...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Mildura Rural City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 05/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP527707<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Environmental & Heritage Services, Management Advisory Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 16]]></description>
