<item><title>Tamworth Regional Entertainment and Conference Centre - Catering Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Tamworth Regional Council (“Council”) operates a range of venues throughout Tamworth including the Tamworth Regional Entertainment & Conference Centre (“TRECC”). This Tender seeks catering operators (“Contractors”) to express interest as to the operation of food services at TRECC at functions only. Functions at TRECC are typically at arm’s length to Council operations. Those catering operators who submit to this tender, if found to be appropriate for such service, will appear on a list of preferred operators for selection by a third-party client who may hire TRECC for their own purposes. <br /><br />29 September 2026	Tender Opens <br /><br />12 October 2026 11am	Site Inspection / Tender Briefing<br /><br />30 October 2026 11am	Tender Closes <br /><br />15 November 2026	Advise successful tenderers<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Tamworth Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 05/Nov/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP527521<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Catering & Hospitality, Event Management & Services, Food & Beverage Products, Travel & Tourism, Venue Hire<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
