<item><title>Palm Island Tourism Commercial &amp; Operating Partner</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Palm Island Aboriginal Shire Council is seeking an experienced Tourism Commercial Development & Operational Readiness Partner to support the development and commercial activation of Palm Island’s emerging tourism offering.<br /><br />The successful Partner will provide specialist tourism, commercial and operational-readiness services, including tourism product and visitor-experience development, commercial and operating-model development, D&C design and delivery interface, marketing and distribution planning, local participation and workforce planning, operational readiness, and assistance to Council to procure and transition to a separate long-term Tourism Operating Partner.<br /><br />The engagement does not include the ongoing day-to-day commercial operation of the tourism offering following Commercial Opening.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Palm Island Aboriginal Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 13/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP525382<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Marcio Fialho Email: marcio.fialho@palmcouncil.qld.gov.au Tel: 0448339292<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Event Management & Services, Marketing & Communications, Training & Development, Travel & Tourism<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 26]]></description>
